From 80ad7d325c1140b3016db17aad2b8b00494a5d7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 18:33:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 097/113] rust: drm: type plane properties and color LUTs

Represent plane rotation, reflection, and pixel-blend properties with Rust types, and expose CRTC gamma entries through a read-only ColorLut view. This keeps KMS drivers on the safe DRM interface instead of generated constants and structures.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-0
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
Signed-off-by: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
---
